  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>«0.20 × 0.80T» = 0.16T ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\times T\\times 0.16T=1800\"></span> ✔ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T=150\"></span> «s» ✔ <br/>Award MP1 for any recognition that area under graph is displacement.</p></section>"
