  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
    "html": "<section class=\"context\"><p>A train starting from rest travels from A to B with acceleration 0.20 m s<sup>−2</sup> and then decelerates to rest from B to C. The total distance from A to C is 1800 m. The graph shows the variation with time of the speed of the train.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The time of travel from A to C is T and the time from A to B is 0.80 T.</p></section><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong> State the speed of the train when at point B in terms of T. [1]</p></section><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong> Determine <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. [2]</p></section>"
  },
